<title>INDIA: STOCKS WHICH MOVED INDIA'S BSE INDEX - AUGUST 12.</title>
<headline>STOCKS WHICH MOVED INDIA'S BSE INDEX - AUGUST 12.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay  Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement at the close of tuesday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day and their percentage contribution to the net change. The index at the close was 4425.03, 56.27 points or 1.26 percent lower than monday's close.</p>
<p>   STOCK	    Weightage   Percent	Percent</p>
<p>			percentage  change in    change in</p>
